xt-align:right;vertical-align:bottom"/><td colspan="3" style="display:none"/><td colspan="3" style="display:none"/></tr></table></div><div style="margin-top:6pt;padding-left:72pt;text-indent:-27pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">(1)</span><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:9pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:16.52pt">The charges incurred in the years ended December 31, 2025 and 2024, were included in restructuring and asset-related charges, net in the accompanying consolidated statement of operations.</span></div></ix:continuation><div style="margin-top:9pt;text-indent:36pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">During 2023, we announced plans to close <ix:nonFraction unitRef="manufacturingfacility" contextRef="c-399" decimals="0" name="jeld:NumberOfManufacturingFacilitiesToClose" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" scale="0" id="f-1869">two</ix:nonFraction> manufacturing facilities, located in Tijuana, Mexico and Vista, California as part of our footprint rationalization activities. We were substantially complete with the facility closures at the end of 2024. </span></div><ix:continuation id="f-1689-4" continuedAt="f-1689-5"><div style="margin-top:9pt;text-indent:36pt"><span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Costs and cash outlays associated with the plans are as follows:</span></div><div style="margin-top:6pt;text-align:center"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:100.000%"><tr><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:40.427%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td style="width:7.927%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:0.494%"/><td style="width:0.1%"/><td style="width:1.0%"/><td st